WEBVTT

00:11:59.321 --> 00:12:01.265
and one cohort of PhD students.

00:12:01.683 --> 00:12:03.643
Our students come from all over the world

00:12:03.667 --> 00:12:04.889
and all over life.

00:12:04.913 --> 00:12:07.508
Australia, New Zealand, Nigeria, Nepal,

00:12:07.532 --> 00:12:09.491
Mexico, India, the United States.

00:12:10.286 --> 00:12:12.686
And they range in age from 23 to 60.

00:12:12.997 --> 00:12:15.981
They variously had backgrounds
in maths and music,

00:12:16.005 --> 00:12:17.750
policy and performance,

00:12:17.774 --> 00:12:19.108
systems and standards,

00:12:19.132 --> 00:12:20.591
architecture and arts.

00:12:21.385 --> 00:12:23.266
Before they joined us at the Institute,

00:12:23.290 --> 00:12:25.528
they ran companies,
they worked for government,

00:12:25.552 --> 00:12:27.749
served in the army, taught high school,

00:12:27.773 --> 00:12:29.840
and managed arts organizations.